    "methods_description": "EEG signals were recorded from 15 healthy subjects (age 24-28 years) using a Grass 8-18-36 amplifier with DataTranslation DT9816 ADC. Six channels (F3, F4, C3, C4, P3, P4) were positioned according to the standard 10-20 montage at a sampling rate of 1024 Hz with online bandpass filtering (2-45 Hz). Subjects performed cue-based imagery tasks of 5 Spanish vowels and 6 directional commands in response to visual stimuli, with trial duration of 4 seconds and imagery period of 3 seconds. Data were preprocessed with bandpass filtering and artifact rejection applied.",
